STEP 2 — Find wh[1Cre[1Cit belongs. List [38;2;177;185;249mdocumentation/modules/ [38;2;255;255;255mand re[1Cd what[1Cis already[6C.[86X[17;3H- If[1Ca d[1Ccument there ALREADY covers this p[1Cay, UPDATE i[1C. Do not[1Cadd a second[1Cdocument ab[1Cut the same [1Ching.[39X[18;5HOtherwise place a new document, respecting the gra[1Cularity tha[1C already [1Cxists. If[1Cthere are module folders, they are this product's modules: pu[1C th[1C document in[1Cthe o[1Ce th[1Cs [19;3Hplay be[1Congs to, and only create a ne[1C module folder if this play genuinely is a[1Cn[1Cw part o[1C the pro[1Cu[1Ct. If the[1Cdocuments are[1Cflat, keep them f[1Cat.[28X[20;3H- If [38;2;177;185;249mdocumentation/modules/ [38;2;255;255;255mis EMPTY, you are choosing the structure. Judge the size of the product from the vision, the tech stack and the repositories, then pick a granularity[21;3Hyou would still be happy with after twenty more plays:[1Ca small product is served well by a few flat[1Cd[1Ccuments, a larger [1Cne by a handful [1Cf module[1Cf[1Cld[1Crs. Say in one line why [22;3Hyou chose what you chose.[23;3H- DEPTH LIMIT:[1Conly [38;2;177;185;249mdocumentation/modules/<name>.md [38;2;255;255;255mor [38;2;177;185;249mdocumentation/modules/<module>/<name>.md [38;2;255;255;255mare poss[1Cble. There is no third level — do not try to nest[1Cdeeper.[14X[39m[24;3H[173X[38;2;255;255;255m
