Cwhole[1Cscreen[1Cfollows[1Cone[1Cstop[1C—[1Cthe[1Cone[1Cthe[1Cuser[1Ctapped[1Cif[1Cthere[1Cis[1Cone,[1Cotherwise[1Cthe[1Cnearest.[1CIt[1Cexplains[1Chow[1Cthe[1Ctapped[1Cstop[1Cis[1Cheld[1Cby[1Cid,[26;3H  why tapping the nearest[1Cstop[1Cshows[1Cit[1Cas[1C"Nearest[1Cstop",[1Cand[1Cwhat[1Chappens[1Cwhen[1Ca[1Crefresh[1Cdrops[1Cthe[1Ctapped[1Cstop.[27;3H-[1m[1CSelecting a stop (new section):[22m
 [1C  - how a tap picks a stop, within 16 px of[1Cthe[1Cpointer;
